                                "sense_id": "ee6cb4c5-9d96-3c65-993c-5cffa89d7a7e",
                                "text": "[D]isclosures about America's own focus on cyberweaponry – including American-led attacks on Iran's nuclear infrastructure and National Security Agency documents revealed in the trove taken by Edward J. Snowden, the former agency contractor – detail the degree to which the United States has engaged in what the intelligence world calls \"cyberexploitation\" of targets in China."
